# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (never commit `.dev.vars`).
# These become bindings on `c.env` in the Worker during `pnpm dev`.

# Shared secret that protects the moderator endpoints (/api/admin/*).
# Without it, the moderator area returns 503. Pick any strong random string.
ADMIN_TOKEN="dev-moderator-token-change-me"

# Optional: Cloudflare Turnstile secret for anti-bot on public submissions.
# Leave unset in local dev to skip the check.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET="0x..."
